	JMP TYRETN	/TTY ALREADY GOING
	TAD I TYPNTO	/WASN'T GOING, HAVE TO START IT
	TLS		/PUT OUT CHARACTER
	CLA IAC		/AND ADJUST POINTER
	TAD TYPNTO	/FOR INTERRUPT HANDLER
	AND TYRING	/BEND POINTER AROUND
	DCA TYPNTO
